                                                "sense_id": "a6eaa6d0-9861-3b9e-907f-5405b8044047",
                                                "text": "By tracing the turns from U.S. to Japan to China, we can see that becoming American, the classic ethnic American narrative, itself opens to further becomings and unbecomings and rebecomings that address mobility and ethnicization […]"
                                            }
